OL,3,AAfrica's richest man, Ethiopia and
OL,4,ADjibouti to build $660m fuel pipeline
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigerian billionaire Aliko Dangote,
OL,7,FEthiopia and Djibouti have agreed to
OL,8,Fdevelop a $660m (#500m) petroleum
OL,9,Fpipeline and storage project linking
OL,10,Fthe two countries.
OL,12,FThe project will include a 120km- (75
OL,13,Fmile-) pipeline connecting Djibouti's
OL,14,FDamerjog port to a distribution
OL,15,Ffacility in Dewele, Ethiopia, as well
OL,16,Fas storage capacity of about 400
OL,17,Fmillion litres.
OL,19,FIt is expected to begin operations
OL,20,Fwithin 18 months.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
