OL,3,AAfrica's richest man, Ethiopia and
OL,4,ADjibouti to build $660m fuel pipeline
OL,5,
OL,6,FEthiopian Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed
OL,7,Fsaid the pipeline would reduce the time
OL,8,Fneeded to transport fuel from
OL,9,FDjibouti's port to the Ethiopian
OL,10,Fcapital, Addis Ababa, from five days to
OL,11,Fone.
